:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Manager
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'financial_centre'>><<effects>><<endevent>>
<<set _estate to maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate>>
<<if !_estate.properties.some(property => _estate.owns(property.id)) or $exposed gt 0 or $stress gte $stressmax>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the property desk', '返回房产柜台'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Office'>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if $per_npc.deadwood_property_manager>>
  <<loadNPC 0 'deadwood_property_manager'>>
<<else>>
  <<generateNPC 1 a>>
<</if>><<person1>>
<<set _managerMet to $NPCList[0].name_known is 1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if _managerMet>>
      <<print $NPCList[0].name>> looks up from a folder of inspection sheets. A key on a numbered tag lies beside each sheet. <<He>> moves the nearest chair out for you.
    <<else>>
      The agent sends you to a smaller desk beside the window. A <<person>> is sorting keys into numbered envelopes. <<He>> finishes one before offering you a seat and introducing <<himself>> as <<print $NPCList[0].name>>.
    <</if>><br><br>
    <<if _estate.manager>>
      "Which house is it?" <<he>> asks, reaching for a pen. "If it's the rent, I can chase it. If it's the roof, I need to book someone who can fix it. They won't come just because I ask nicely."
    <<else>>
      "I manage houses for several owners," <<he>> says. "I can inspect yours, chase late rent and book repairs. You choose which ones I look after. You can keep a spare key."
    <</if>><br><br>
    <<He>> draws a line beneath the fees. "Each house costs <span class='gold'><<= (_estate.rentalTerms.managementFeeRate * 100).toFixed(0)>>% of its assessed weekly rent</span>, at least <<printmoney _estate.rentalTerms.managementMinimumPennies>> a week. That's charged even if you live there yourself. <span class='gold'>Repairs cost extra.</span> Leave enough in the bank. I don't put your bills on credit."
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if _managerMet>>
      <<print $NPCList[0].name>>从一叠房屋检查表中抬起头。每张表旁边都放着一把挂着编号牌的钥匙。<<He>>拉开离你最近的椅子。
    <<else>>
      中介让你去窗边的小办公桌。一位<<person>>正把钥匙分别装进写着编号的信封。<<He>>装好手上的那把，请你坐下，告诉你自己叫<<print $NPCList[0].name>>。
    <</if>><br><br>
    <<if _estate.manager>>
      “哪套房子？”<<he>>问，拿起一支笔。“要是租金，我可以去催。要是屋顶，就得找人修。光靠好声好气地说，可请不动维修工。”
    <<else>>
      “我替几位房主照看房子，”<<he>>说。“查查房况，催租，安排维修。哪些房子交给我，你来选。备用钥匙你可以留着。”
    <</if>><br><br>
    <<He>>在收费条款下划了一道线。“每套房子每周收<span class='gold'>当时应收周租金的 <<= (_estate.rentalTerms.managementFeeRate * 100).toFixed(0)>>%</span>，至少<<printmoney _estate.rentalTerms.managementMinimumPennies>>。自己住的也收。<span class='gold'>维修另算钱。</span>银行里得留够余额，我不会替你刷信用卡。”
<</language>>
<<set $NPCList[0].name_known to 1>><<saveNPC 0 'deadwood_property_manager'>><br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The agreement authorises routine repairs when condition falls to <<= _estate.rentalTerms.repairCondition>>, leak repairs, and following up rent after a week. It does not authorise renovations, new tenancies or purchases. <span class='red'>Unfunded work waits; frozen houses and houses awaiting auction are excluded.</span>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    协议允许管理员在房况降至 <<= _estate.rentalTerms.repairCondition>> 时安排修缮、修补漏水，并在租金迟付一周后催收。不包括装修、另找租客或买房。<span class='red'>钱不够，工作就得等。被冻结或等待拍卖的房子暂停管理。</span>
<</language>><br><br>
<<if _estate.manager>>
  <<refuseicon>><<lanLink ['End the management agreement', '解除物业管理协议'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Office'>>
    <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate.employManager(false)>><<endevent>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<<elseif $Finance.bank.debit_card>>
  <<icon 'property/management.png'>><<lanLink ['Hire the manager', '聘请管理员'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Office'>>
    <<run maplebirch.get('Finance').realEstate.employManager(true)>><<endevent>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<lanSwitch 'After signing, assign individual houses at the property desk. Fees begin with their next weekly settlement.' '签约后，在房产柜台逐套指定房源。服务费从各房源的下一次周结算开始收取。'>><br>
<<else>>
  <span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'A debit card is required to authorise bank payments.' '需要借记卡才能授权银行付款。'>></span><br>
<</if>>
<<deadwood-reblooms-adrian-counter-link>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the property desk', '返回房产柜台'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Office'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Small Repair Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-home-repair-check'>>
  <<set _home_repair_finance to maplebirch.get('Finance'), _home_repair_estate to _home_repair_finance?.realEstate>>
  <<set _home_repair_property to _home_repair_estate?.current>>
  <<set _home_repair_management to _home_repair_property ? _home_repair_estate.managementFor(_home_repair_property.id) : null>>
  <<set _home_repair_safe to _home_repair_property and !_home_repair_property.tenure
    and !_home_repair_management.rented and _home_repair_management.auction_day is null
    and $location is 'deadwood_home' and !$combat and !$possessed and !$eventforced
    and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues
    and $stress lt $stressmax and !isPregnancyEnding()>>
  <<set _home_repair_condition to _home_repair_management?.condition ?? 100>>
  <<set _home_repair_mode to _args[0] ?? 'seal', _home_repair_minutes to _home_repair_mode is 'frame' ? 30 : 45>>
  <<set _home_repair_gain to Math.max(0, Math.min(90 - _home_repair_condition, _home_repair_mode is 'frame' ? 5 : 3))>>
  <!-- 材料按原整修单价估算，只处理门窗小毛病，不代替整体修缮。 -->
  <<set _home_repair_cost to _home_repair_gain gt 0 and _home_repair_property
    ? Math.max(500, Math.ceil(_home_repair_estate.repairCost(_home_repair_property.id) / (100 - _home_repair_condition) * _home_repair_gain * 0.4)) : 0>>
  <<set _home_repair_ready to _home_repair_safe and ['seal', 'frame'].includes(_home_repair_mode)
    and _home_repair_condition gte 60 and _home_repair_condition lt 90
    and !pcAreArmsBound('any') and $tiredness lt (_args[1] ? C.tiredness.max : C.tiredness.max / 2)
    and currentSkillValue('housekeeping') gte (_home_repair_mode is 'frame' ? 600 : 300)
    and (_home_repair_mode isnot 'frame' or currentSkillValue('physique') gte $physiquesize * 4 / 7)>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-home-repair-link'>>
  <<deadwood-home-repair-check>>
  <<if _home_repair_safe and _home_repair_condition lt 90>>
    <<icon 'property/repair.png'>><<lanLink ['Inspect the worn fittings', '检查磨损的门窗'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Small Repair'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-home-repair-option'>>
  <<deadwood-home-repair-check _args[0]>>
  <<if !_home_repair_ready>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<capture _home_repair_mode _home_repair_property _home_repair_management _home_repair_condition>>
    <<if $Finance.bank.opened and $Finance.bank.debit_card and $Finance.bank.balance gte _home_repair_cost>>
      <<lanLink `[_home_repair_mode is 'frame' ? 'Steady the door (0:30)' : 'Replace the seals (0:45)', _home_repair_mode is 'frame' ? '扶正门扇 (0:30)' : '更换密封条 (0:45)']`>>
        <<deadwood-home-repair-act _home_repair_mode _home_repair_property _home_repair_management _home_repair_condition>>
      <</lanLink>>
    <<else>>
      <<lanSwitch `_home_repair_mode is 'frame' ? ['Steady the door (0:30)', '扶正门扇 (0:30)'] : ['Replace the seals (0:45)', '更换密封条 (0:45)']`>>
    <</if>>
    — <<printmoney _home_repair_cost>> · <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Condition +' '房况 +'>><<print _home_repair_gain>></span><<gtiredness>>
    <<if $Finance.bank.opened and $Finance.bank.debit_card and $Finance.bank.balance lt _home_repair_cost>> · <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'Not enough money in the bank' '银行余额不足'>></span><</if>><br>
  <</capture>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-home-repair-act'>>
  <<set $_repair_mode to _args[0], $_repair_property to _args[1], $_repair_management to _args[2], $_repair_condition to _args[3]>>
  <<deadwood-home-repair-check $_repair_mode>>
  <<if !_home_repair_ready or $passage isnot 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Small Repair'
      or _home_repair_property isnot $_repair_property or _home_repair_management isnot $_repair_management
      or _home_repair_condition isnot $_repair_condition
      or !$Finance.bank.opened or !$Finance.bank.debit_card or $Finance.bank.balance lt _home_repair_cost>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<set $_repair_source to $passage, $_repair_cost to _home_repair_cost, $_repair_gain to _home_repair_gain,
    $_repair_minutes to _home_repair_minutes, $_repair_end to Time.date.timeStamp + _home_repair_minutes * 60>>
  <<pass $_repair_minutes>>
  <!-- 开工须精神充足；正常劳作后越过半量疲劳，不因此白做。 -->
  <<deadwood-home-repair-check $_repair_mode true>>
  <!-- 完整耗时与现场复核后才付材料费、恢复房况，旧链接不能修另一套房。 -->
  <<if _home_repair_ready and $passage is $_repair_source and Time.date.timeStamp gte $_repair_end
      and _home_repair_property is $_repair_property and _home_repair_management is $_repair_management
      and _home_repair_condition is $_repair_condition
      and _home_repair_finance.payFromBankPennies($_repair_cost) is 'ok'>>
    <<set $_repair_management.condition to $_repair_condition + $_repair_gain>>
    <<tiredness `$_repair_mode is 'frame' ? 8 : 6`>>
    <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Small Repair Finish'>>
  <<elseif $passage is $_repair_source and maplebirch.passage.title is $passage
      and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze and !$frozenValues and ($nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck or $eventforced)>>
    <<replace '#deadwood-home-repair-message'>><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $_repair_source>><</lanLink>><</replace>>
    <<run updateMoment()>>
  <<elseif $passage is $_repair_source and !$eventforced and !$frozenValues and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck and !$combat and !$possessed and !$replayScene and !$statFreeze>>
    <<replace '#deadwood-home-repair-message'>>
      <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You stop before fitting the new materials. The work is unfinished, and no material payment has been taken.' '你没有继续装上新材料。小修还没完成，也没有扣取材料费。'>></span><br>
    <</replace>>
    <<run updateMoment()>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Small Repair
<<set _home_repair_estate to maplebirch.get('Finance')?.realEstate>>
<<if !_home_repair_estate?.current>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to High Street', '返回商业街'] 'High Street'>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<run _home_repair_estate.setFloor(1)>><<run _home_repair_estate.enter()>><<home_effects>><<effects>>
<<deadwood-home-repair-check>>
<span class='gold'><<lanSwitch 'Small repairs' '门窗小修'>></span><br><br>
<<lanSwitch 'Condition: ' '房屋状况：'>><<print _home_repair_condition>> / 100<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You check the window seals and the way the door sits in its frame. Replacing small worn pieces could keep the draught out. It will not mend a roof or put damaged walls right. Materials must be paid for from your bank account.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你检查窗边的密封条，又试了试房门。换掉磨损的小零件，能让门窗关严些，却修不好屋顶和墙里的毛病。材料费要从银行账户结清。
<</language>><br><br>
<<if _home_repair_safe and _home_repair_condition gte 60 and _home_repair_condition lt 90>>
  <<deadwood-home-repair-option 'seal'>>
  <<deadwood-home-repair-option 'frame'>>
  <<if pcAreArmsBound('any')>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You need both hands free to work on the fittings.' '得先让双手都能活动，才能动手修理。'>></span><br>
  <<elseif $tiredness gte C.tiredness.max / 2>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You are too tired to steady the pieces safely. Rest first.' '你累得有些扶不稳零件，先歇一歇吧。'>></span><br>
  <<elseif currentSkillValue('housekeeping') lt 300>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You need more practice with household work before attempting the repairs.' '你还需要多练练家务，再试着自己修理。'>></span><br>
  <</if>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Replacing seals needs practised housekeeping. Steadying the door needs greater skill and strength. Small repairs can bring the condition up to 90; the rest needs professional work.' '更换密封条需要熟练的家务本领，扶正门扇还得更有经验、也更有力气。小修最多把房况修到90，其余得请维修工。'>><br>
  <<if !$Finance.bank.opened or !$Finance.bank.debit_card>>
    <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'You need an open bank account and a debit card to pay for materials.' '支付材料费需要已开通的银行账户与借记卡。'>></span><br>
  <</if>>
<<elseif _home_repair_condition lt 60>>
  <span class='purple'><<lanSwitch 'The damage is beyond small repairs. You need a professional to put the house right.' '这里的损坏已经不是换些小零件能解决的了，得找维修工。'>></span><br>
<<elseif _home_repair_condition gte 90>>
  <<lanSwitch 'The fittings do not need further small repairs. Restoring the rest of the house is a job for a professional.' '能自己处理的小毛病已经不多了。想把房子完全修好，还是得请维修工。'>><br>
<</if>>
<br><span id='deadwood-home-repair-message'></span>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the sitting room', '返回起居室'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Home'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Property Small Repair Finish
<<set _home_repair_estate to maplebirch.get('Finance')?.realEstate>>
<<if !_home_repair_estate?.current>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to High Street', '返回商业街'] 'High Street'>><</lanLink>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<run _home_repair_estate.enter()>><<home_effects>><<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You test the fittings you have worked on, then gather the old pieces and put the leftover materials away. The door closes more neatly. The materials are paid for; the worn parts you could not reach still need proper repairs.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你试过刚处理的几处地方，清走换下来的旧零件，收好剩下的材料。房门关得严实了些。材料费已经结清，没能处理的磨损仍得另外修缮。
<</language>><<gtiredness>><br><br>
<<lanSwitch 'Condition: ' '房屋状况：'>><<print _home_repair_estate.managementFor(_home_repair_estate.current.id).condition>> / 100<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the sitting room', '返回起居室'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Property Home'>><</lanLink>><br>
